Spec: Actual hole-punch authority binding

Purpose:
  Keep every pending hole-punch session bound to its approved visitor, publisher and current service authority.

Owns:
  ./linkgate.go
  ./linkgate_test.go

References:
  /control-plane/authority/transport_gate.sdd

Must:
  Secure controllers require an actual proxy/kind-bound authority handle on precheck and actual visitor requests; bypassing precheck never bypasses authorization.
  Accept client replies only for the exact pending proxy and authenticated publisher namespace, and reports only from the authorized session sides.
  Stop pending waits and suppress candidate responses when the authority closes; delayed replies cannot revive a removed or revoked session.
  Accept a publisher reply only once and bound reports to one per authorized side after analysis is ready.
